   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CRD Human Rights 2010-12</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">CRD Human Rights 2010-12</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet bygger p&#xe5; tidigare samarbete med ett antal                  partnerorganisationer och omfattar tre omr&#xe5;den; r&#xe4;ttsstatsprincipen,  yttrandefrihet och frihet fr&#xe5;n diskriminering. Syftet &#xe4;r att &#xf6;ka      respekten f&#xf6;r m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter, och Civil Rights Defenders       arbetar med tv&#xe5; eller tre organisationer inom varje omr&#xe5;de.           Partnerorganisationerna och CRD samarbetar i gemensamma projekt.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project builds on previous cooperation with a number of partner   organizations and covers three areas: rule of law, freedom of         expression and freedom from discrimination. The aim is to increase    respect for human rights, and Civil Rights Defenders is working with  two or three organizations in each area. Partner organizations and    CRD cooperate in joint projects.</narrative>
  </description>
